WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.055
Open your link and sign in
with an email code, or with
LinkedIn.

2
00:00:04.735 --> 00:00:06.379
Tell us your batch and
branch.

3
00:00:06.379 --> 00:00:09.568
Paste your LinkedIn text, or
just tap "Fill my profile".

4
00:00:10.348 --> 00:00:13.964
To join the Grand Reunion,
tap Register.

5
00:00:13.964 --> 00:00:19.026
Choose your ticket: ₹2,500
for 26 December, now 25% off.

6
00:00:19.026 --> 00:00:23.455
Add the optional 27 December
tour, ₹650 a person.

7
00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:28.004
Then pay by UPI and enter the
12-digit reference.

8
00:00:28.384 --> 00:00:32.878
Your QR entry pass appears.
Show it at the gate. It even
works offline.

9
00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:36.806
To find batchmates, open
Menu, then Find JECians.

10
00:00:36.806 --> 00:00:40.425
Search by name, batch or
city, and tap to chat.

11
00:00:40.805 --> 00:00:44.400
Share event photos and
videos: open Menu, Reunion

12
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.602
photos & videos, then Add
photos & videos.

13
00:00:47.882 --> 00:00:51.735
Post a story that lasts 24
hours, or see what's new on
Home.

14
00:00:52.015 --> 00:00:55.577
Finally, add the app to your
home screen for one-tap
access.

15
00:00:55.857 --> 00:00:59.326
JEC Alumni Connect. Your
batch, your college, one app.
